{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43932","headline":"拜新月 · 张夫人","name":"拜新月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拜新月，拜月出堂前。\n暗魄初笼桂，虚弓未引弦。\n拜新月，拜月妆楼上。\n鸾镜始安台，蛾眉已相向。\n拜新月，拜月不胜情，庭花风露清。\n月临人自老，人望月长明。\n东家阿母亦拜月，一拜一悲声断绝。\n昔年拜月逞容辉，如今拜月双泪垂。\n回看衆女拜新月，却忆红闺年少时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张夫人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43932.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43932","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}